# Point the workspace at a running Luminary API.
#
# Unset — which is the default, and what the standalone single-file build always
# is — the app runs in demo mode: seeded data, in-memory state, credentials
# checked in the browser. Set, it runs live: the server owns authentication,
# tenancy, the audit trail, and every record.
#
# There is no middle state. A failed request in live mode is an error, never a
# quiet fall back to seeded patients.
#
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000

# The API must allow this origin. On the server side:
#   WEB_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5174,http://127.0.0.1:5174
